OL,3,ARuPaul's Drag Race UK crowns winner as
OL,4,ABBC axes the series
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article includes spoilers
OL,7,Ffor the finale of RuPaul's Drag Race
OL,8,FUK.
OL,10,FAfter 10 weeks of toe-to-toe lip-syncs,
OL,11,Ffierce runways and shady remarks, the
OL,12,Ftime has come for one queen to be named
OL,13,Fthe UK's next Drag Race superstar.
OL,15,FFor the final time on the BBC, 12
OL,16,Fcontestants were whittled down to just
OL,17,Fone after the broadcaster announced it
OL,18,Fwas axing RuPaul's Drag Race UK due to
OL,19,Fbudget cuts.
OL,21,FOn Thursday night, RuPaul crowned Flesh
OL,22,Fas the series eight winner.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
